<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Demo: Healthcare Agent Orchestrator (HAO) for Patient Summarization in Molecular Tumor Boards<span class="ltx_pubnotes"><span class="ltx_pubnotes_content"><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_thanks"><span class="ltx_note_name">Thanks: </span>Correspondence: <span id="id2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">hlsfrontierteam@microsoft.com</span></span></span></span></h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
